WEBVTT

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:05.480
<i>No. 4 Division betrays the rest 
of Annex 1 in an attempt to acquire</i>

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.110
<i>Akari and Michelle's special bodies.</i>

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:11.940
<i>In response to this emergency, the US, 
Japanese, and Russian teams form an alliance,</i>

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.990
<i>but then the terraformars attack.</i>

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:19.780
<i>A three-way battle begins 
on the plains of Mars.</i>

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.500
<i>Bao finally succeeds in 
capturing Akari and Michelle.</i>

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:30.190
<i>He launches Yaeko into a crowd 
of terraformars as a decoy,</i>

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:33.260
<i>and Alex follows her even 
though he can't fight.</i>

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.720
<i>The situation is dire.</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:40.140
<i>Then the leader of No. 6 
Division, Joseph, arrives.</i>

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.280
Wh-What are you doing here?

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:47.150
Don't worry.

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:51.030
Your beautiful love brought me here.

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.530
<b><i>The Leader</i></b>

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:42.180
Alex! Yaeko!

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:44.290
Where...

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:47.310
Where have you been?

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:54.410
Joe!

00:02:57.890 --> 00:02:59.450
I'm here.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.240
<i>Th-This man...</i>

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.700
<i>Why is he naked?!</i>

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:10.370
<i>And wait... he's still fully human.</i>

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:13.020
<i>He hasn't transformed.</i>

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.590
Now then...

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.510
W-W-W-Wait...

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:23.670
H-He's a pervert who doesn't transform?!

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:28.990
Here.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.810
I have one syringe of avian drug left.

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:36.710
He's avian, right?

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:39.230
Why?

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:40.300
Hurry.

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:41.820
There's a 50/50 chance 
he makes a full recovery,

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.630
but there's not a moment to waste.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:45.160
Okay!

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:49.240
You'll be fine, too.

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:50.550
The drug will heal you.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.180
<i>He's the Roman...</i>

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.920
<i>The No. 6 Division leader!</i>

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:14.440
<i>What's he doing here?</i>

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.230
Th-They're coming!

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:28.870
Leave it to me.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.380
Leave it to you?

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:34.840
You're going to fight all these terraformars?

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.080
Alone?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.340
What? What?

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.850
Are you concentrating?

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.550
Are you asleep?

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:45.300
Okay!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.680
Come get me all at once!

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.060
It's better that way!

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:13.750
<i>I remember something 
Michelle-san once said...</i>

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:19.960
Joe?

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.540
Oh, that's right.

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:25.820
Track and Field Joe. He was on TV.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:29.140
In his last year of high school,

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:31.140
at the young age of 17,

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.890
he won the gold medal in a decathlon.

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:38.990
The decathlon that they 
call the King of Athletes.

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:44.880
After that, he quit the track and field 
team like other high school students.

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:49.960
He studied for exams and got 
into the EU's best university.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:54.280
At the same time, he went to 
an elite air force officer's school

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:56.500
and graduated with 
extraordinarily high grades.

00:05:57.720 --> 00:06:01.670
He studied masters degrees in biology 
and aerospace engineering,

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.300
and became an air force officer.

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:07.980
The freedom he's been 
allowed in his career is a

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.620
reflection of the power of his backers,

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:11.610
and the trust that's been placed in them.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:16.890
That is because he's from the 
main family of a particular clan.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.330
Good work.

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:34.470
Yaeko-chan, grab on tight.

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:35.560
Right here.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.410
Take us to full power.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:41.750
Don't let your hand relax for a second.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.800
We're going to catch up to Michelle-san!

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:54.550
They're coming from up front, too!

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.010
We'll just go forward.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:03.540
Y-You're fighting there?!

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:08.350
Michelle-san,

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.530
I'm coming!

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:16.910
Joe's clan are said to be 
artificially-created humans.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:19.790
Their marriage partners are chosen

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:24.000
without regard for wealth, 
connections, race, or nationality.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.490
There are only three factors:

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:28.220
looks, abilities, and disease resistance.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:33.340
In other words, they're 
breeding a better human.

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:38.720
The base is the human, the mightiest 
creature in the animal kingdom,

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:44.520
with the endurance and heart/lung capacity 
to run 42.195 kilometers an hour at full speed.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:48.360
The throwing ability that drove 
the mammoths to extinction.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:54.410
The intelligence and learning 
capabilities of an IQ of 186.

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:59.410
The digestion and absorption abilities that 
allow it to immediately use what it eats.

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:07.840
The sense of touch in its hands allows 
it to create any kind of artistic tool,

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:10.050
and use it like a master.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.670
<i>It took 600 years.</i>

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:18.210
<i>Soon humanity will become human.</i>

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:22.730
<i>The creatures closest to 
God shall be complete.</i>

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:33.670
We caught up already?

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.430
They're back!

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:57.920
When you're giving someone 
the M.O. surgery for combat,

00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:01.790
the original human's strength 
has a huge influence on the success.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:05.950
So we knew he had to be the strongest.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:13.110
He is Rank 1.

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:26.670
M.A.R.S Ranking 1.

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:29.230
<b>M.A.R.S. Ranking 1</b>

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.400
The final destination of humanity,

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.000
Joseph G. Newton.

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:35.580
<b>M.A.R.S. Ranking 1
Joseph G. Newton
Surgery Base: Unknown</b>

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.030
I'm here.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:49.810
I'm here.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:57.530
Joe...

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:00.760
Michelle-san, just wait a little longer.

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:03.040
<i>Is he an enemy? Or...?</i>

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.660
I'll save you. 100%.

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:09.540
Even if it means fighting Rank 1,

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:13.250
my mission to bring back the First 
and the Second doesn't change.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:16.140
Even if it means fighting Rank 1?

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:18.340
As if you could even try.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:42.990
Michelle-san,

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:44.500
who's going to win this fight?

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:47.410
There are several factors that 
will determine the victor.

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:51.900
First, the terraformars. 
They're attacking us during the battle.

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:56.090
That gives him a disadvantage, since he's got 
his back to the direction we're traveling.

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:59.380
They're swinging their 
swords while they fight.

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:02.230
This gives Joseph-san a disadvantage, 
because his sword is heavier.

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:04.220
And then there's range.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:07.030
Joe's got the longer blade, so he wins there.

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.570
But...

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:11.160
Air resistance, and the laws of momentum.

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.810
Since he's standing upwind, 
he has the advantage there.

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:19.110
He let go of his sword?

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.410
Is he trying to regroup?

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.240
I won't let you escape.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.420
I figured you'd know, though.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.720
Or did you forget?

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:48.150
Terraformars have a priority 
list for their targets.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:50.450
The wounded.

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:52.120
The alone.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:53.430
Women.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:55.700
And those with tools.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:00.540
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:03.310
<i>I need to use the drug to cure my wounds.</i>

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.330
<i>But how to get the time?</i>

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:09.870
Michelle-san!

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:16.540
<i>I'll kick the First out of the 
vehicle to distract the terraformars!</i>

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:23.380
The hell do you think you're doing, asshole?

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:29.560
Hey, whatcha doin'?

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.210
You'll never know.

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:44.700
If you're the kind of person 
who'd kick a woman out of a car,

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.200
you'll never know.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:50.160
Are you one of the hardshell types 
who can regenerate their limbs?

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:53.970
Then, there's a 1 in 10,000 
chance you'll survive, but...

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:57.740
If you come after Michelle-san again,

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:59.930
I'll chop you up until you're sorbet!

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:13.260
I can't regenerate a wound like this.

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:34.080
You'll go after the guy with the sword.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.240
I'm starting to get it.

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:45.390
To you terraformars, this sword 
is the blade of Kusanagi.

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:49.680
A symbol of power taken from 
the outside and absorbed.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:54.790
Your minds developed in a special 
environment with no "outside".

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:56.850
Perhaps it's the laws of nature,

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:59.420
or the guidance of the gods of Rahab,

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:02.400
but it's an interesting evolution.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:06.090
But I still can't let you have it.

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.190
Chase after this!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.870
Michelle-san, we're going 
to be running for a while.

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:17.040
Joe, wait.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.130
No, no. I can't fight this many!

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:23.520
Even if I am Rank 1, 
I can't fight all these guys.

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:24.910
100% no.

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:26.990
<b>Rank 1</b>

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:27.010
I'm Rank 1 and I say so, 
so I've gotta be right.

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:28.750
No, Joe.

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:30.760
What happened to the crew of No. 6 Division?

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:40.220
That thing.

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:43.090
That water beam that's been attacking us.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:46.040
That's the ability of M.A.R.S. Rank 11,

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.000
the banded archerfish.

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:50.200
It seems to have been destroyed.

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.680
It was a girl named Marcia-san.

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:56.740
Her range wasn't as far.

00:14:58.220 --> 00:15:02.770
No. 6 Division was attacked multiple 
times immediately after landing,

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:05.670
and then the first night...

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:09.630
I decided that, if we were surrounded, 
I couldn't protect everyone.

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:13.300
So I used swarming pheromones to get 
a huge army of them to come after me.

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:17.130
I evacuated the non-combatants by vehicle,

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:21.940
and left Marcia-san and one 
other in charge of them.

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:27.260
I thought I'd gotten all the 
terraformars in the area, but...

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:30.330
I see.

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.090
It's okay!

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:35.630
I threw away the clothes 
with the pheromones on them.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.010
So that's where your clothes went.

00:15:38.010 --> 00:15:39.640
The pervert was in big trouble!

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:41.490
I'm sorry,

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:44.620
for being dressed in such an 
arousing manner around women...

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:46.610
No, not really arousing.

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:47.880
Not at all.

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:51.650
I really am sorry.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:55.000
I'm giving off another type of pheromone.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.000
No, not really.

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:58.610
Yaeko-chan,

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:00.900
give some of the drug to these two.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:03.370
You can move now, right?

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:04.690
Okay!

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:09.690
But how did you know how to find us, Joe?

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.910
I saw their signal.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:15.910
<i>Their signal brought him here?</i>

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.910
<i>It brought all those terraformars, 
as well as Rank 1.</i>

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:22.200
And there was that terrible smell.

00:16:25.810 --> 00:16:27.220
Sorry.

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:29.710
I-I'm fine.

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:31.970
Thanks.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:35.040
<i>Until a moment ago, I was suspicious.</i>

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:39.230
<i>So many people have been after us today,</i>

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:44.320
<i>I thought he might not heal us.</i>

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:46.390
<b>Hizamaru Akari
Recovered 5 broken bones, 
except for the one that shattered.
Fever and strength loss are still serious.</b>

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:47.600
<i>I thought he might not undo the ropes.</i>

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:50.430
<b>Yanasegawa Yaeko
Holes in stomach and stink glands:
Recovered.</b>

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:51.000
<i>But I'm glad.</i>

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:54.390
<b>Alex K. Stewart
Gunshot wound to left leg: Recovered.
Multiple broken ribs: Recovered.
Damage to spinal cord: Unknown.
Coma, minor blood loss: Need treatment.</b>

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.770
<i>Today...</i>

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:57.610
<b>Michelle K. Davis
Minor broken bones completely healed,
but badly dehydrated and unable to transform.
Needs treatment and sleep.</b>

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:57.310
<i>I thought I would die so many times today.</i>

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:00.950
Are we losing the terraformars?

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:03.280
Yes, it's fine.

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:07.480
I need water. Water.

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:08.760
That first.

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:10.590
Here.

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:14.560
Yaeko, I'm glad you're safe.

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.430
Yeah...

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:19.930
<i>I'm so glad, really...</i>

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:23.180
<i>When we use the drug to transform,</i>

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:29.290
<i>we destroy our human organs ultra-rapidly 
and create different ones.</i>

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:34.150
<i>The more you use the drug the 
shorter your lifespan gets.</i>

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:37.260
Michelle-san, where's the drug you had?

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.240
I used it all.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:41.880
I'm aware of the effects.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:44.600
You fought until you ran out of drugs?

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.060
It must've been so hard until now.

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:48.790
But it's okay now.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.950
Because I, Rank 1,

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:56.470
am here!

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:59.060
The masterpiece of humanity!

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.480
Humanity's most powerful warrior 
is here with his sword,

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.890
Michelle-san, and he's on your side!

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:08.850
It's really great to have Rank 1 on our side!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:09.670
Right?

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:10.710
Yeah.

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:17.120
From now on, Rank 1 will fight with you.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:19.950
And when we get back to Earth,

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:23.120
I want you to think about 
sharing a future with me!

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:41.600
I think all the parties on Mars 
have gotten together about now.

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:46.630
What do you think, Petra-san?

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.300
U-NASA 6th Branch Office
Roman Commonwealth President
 Luke Snorresson

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:48.370
U-NASA 5th Branch Office
German Prime Minister Petra Eheim

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.690
About now?

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:49.930
Yes.

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:55.390
Our Joe is probably getting lots of 
samples of the A.E virus right now.

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:58.700
We're talking about Earth right now.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:02.780
We're discussing if you Romans will 
be willing to join the encirclement of

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:06.500
Branch Office 4 that was proposed by 
Japan's prime minister Hiruma. Are you in?

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:09.940
I'm not sure.

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:14.120
So the room Rome prepared 
is completely soundproof?

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:15.170
They're pretty careful.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:16.710
Hey, Tacchan.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:22.330
Why do you think the people on Mars now 
aren't getting sick with the A.E virus?

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:26.390
No one made a big deal about the fact 
that they weren't wearing masks,

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.310
so I didn't really think about it.

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:32.440
But the terraformars on Mars 
might have a killer virus, right?

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:35.440
It's strange, isn't it?

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:39.060
That virus goes against everything 
we know about virology.

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:41.610
And then there's its relationship 
to the Mosaic Organ.

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:49.470
You also said that about
 four days after we met.

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:50.910
He's said it before?

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:54.130
You shouldn't say that stuff as a joke.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.060
No, Michelle-san!

00:19:56.060 --> 00:19:58.920
Everything I say, from 1 to Z,

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.300
is seriously serious,

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:01.680
and seriously real!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.090
I have to say it now!

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:09.140
Because we don't know if 
we'll live to see the morrow!

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:12.310
I may be a failure who can't protect his men but,

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:14.060
Michelle-san,

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:20.420
I will make a vaccine and 
get you back to Earth!

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:22.140
When that happens...

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:24.620
I want you to marry me!

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:26.950
M-Marry him?

00:20:27.470 --> 00:20:30.250
<i>Die, narcissist.</i>

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:30.240
<b>Take the hint, 
asshole.</b>

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:31.770
<i>Is what I want to say, but I can't!</i>

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:34.420
<i>He saved my comrades!</i>

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.130
Michelle-san!

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.880
Um... well...

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:46.880
I know.

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:50.680
I'll give you a good spot 
on the list of candidates.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.900
Yes!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.310
Once we get back to Earth 
we'll start with dinner.

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:58.090
Just the two of us!

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:01.030
No. Lunch. Lunch is fine.

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:03.070
It would be more fun if 
everyone else was there.

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:04.280
Right, Akari?

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:05.570
Right?

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:07.780
R-Right...

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.530
We can all have a lunch.

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:10.830
In a bar!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:11.620
A cafe.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:12.850
A private room!

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:13.810
A terrace.

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:29.590
It should almost be time...

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:50.960
They're on the move.

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:53.120
The crew of No. 4 Division are leaving Annex 1.

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:56.080
Now we can sneak in while 
they're not looking...

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:03.730
Look what we have here!

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:40.980
Colony

00:23:37.150 --> 00:23:40.980
No matter how many come,
 I'll kill them all.
